  "requirement": "Return a snapshot of the observations collected so far. Later reads continue to contribute to this execution.\n\n```rust,ignore\nimpl<'d, D: Domain> ValidationContext<'d, D> {\n    pub fn dependencies(&self) -> Vec<Dependency<NodeId<D>, D::EdgeLabel>>;\n}\n```",
